	"TagLine": "Cacti will hurt you a bit if you touch them (by clicking or running into them). Ouch!",
	"Description": "Cacti Hurt You\n![](https://i.imgur.com/MI23tSv.gif)\nCacti in the desert and the ones you plant will hurt you a little bit when you either run into them or click on them. Ouch!\n(You won't be hurt when harvesting cactus fruit from cacti, when the cacti plant is a seed, or when you water your cactus.)\n\nRequires SMAPI by Pathoschild.[Check out my other mods by clicking here!](https://www.nexusmods.com/users/44734342?tab=user+files)",
